ience. Slow down, observe your surroundings, explore carefully, and review data to uncover the path forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/606160/extras/1184551c8a284c2edb0100f23dff7d07.poster.avif?t=1774567361\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/606160/extras/1184551c8a284c2edb0100f23dff7d07.webm?t=1774567361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/606160/extras/1184551c8a284c2edb0100f23dff7d07.mp4?t=1774567361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 EXPLORE: Roam through contrasting sectors of the lunar base, from deteriorating living quarters and tram stations to an abandoned mall. \u258c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 OBSERVE: Investigate your surroundings and uncover crucial information to progress and piece together the events that unfolded before your arrival. \u258c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 IMMERSE: Full body awareness, diegetic audio, and minimal UI help create a gripping and atmospheric experience. \u258c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 OPERATE: Your Cosmonaut Assistance Tool (C.A.T.) is vital. Use it to access critical terminals, navigate the environment and identify clues. \u258c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 SURVIVE: Run, hide, or attempt to defend yourself against unknown threats using the C.A.T. as a last resort. \u258c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/606160/extras/01b19fa30a98b76d9b56d3e4606cf0e7.avif?t=1774567361\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/606160/extras_big/01b19fa30a98b76d9b56d3e4606cf0e7.webp?t=1774567361 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p>","developers":["Lunar Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/606160/ebdc630cc5e78005f5912721bca3a70bdc620a7e/header.jpg?t=1774567361","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9\ufe0f Copyright 2025 Lunar Software. Developed by Lunar Software. Published by Raw Fury AB. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":79,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/routine?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/606160/809873190/e5c0884b0f683daeb1d43c163ace75cdda3f76e0/1768996838/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768997691","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/606160/809873190/e5c0884b0f683daeb1d43c163ace75cdda3f76e0/1768996838/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768997691","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/606160/809873190/e5c0884b0f683daeb1d43c163ace75cdda3f76e0/1768996838/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768997691","id":257252734,"name":"Accolades","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252734/101e26721cacf32141fbf3b3056fe73f7afc0b8a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768997691"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/606160/1987130420/2adfb6270eb23fdb55912e2593996465c651dc9d/1764766634/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764860213","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/606160/1987130420/2adfb6270eb23fdb55912e25939